.TH geectl-pull-request-reopen 1  "geectl-pull-request-reopen 0.2.4" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-pull\-request\-reopen \- Reopen a pull request. On OBS this changes a declined request back to `new`; on Gitea it reopens the closed pull request. Dry\-run by default; mutates only with `\-\-live`
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl pull\-request reopen\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIREFERENCE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reopen a pull request. On OBS this changes a declined request back to `new`; on Gitea it reopens the closed pull request. Dry\-run by default; mutates only with `\-\-live`
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIREFERENCE\fR>
The pull\-request handle: `obs:<id>` or `gitea:<owner>/<repo>#<number>`
.SH VERSION
v0.2.4
